    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d746">

                <pb facs="0862" n="742" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg742"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Ambassador
                    McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. McCormick to ascertain the status of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Calchas</hi>, whether the appeal by the Russian procurer
                    was against the entire decision of the Vladivostok prize court covering vessel
                    and cargo; and if appeal did not extend to the cargo to ascertain what
                    disposition was made of the merchandise declared to be noncontraband.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
